{"seq":2,"slug":"caching-strategies","title":"缓存策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-production-engineering/service-worker/caching-strategies","wordCount":1258,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存策略\">缓存策略</h1><p>Service Worker 真正的力量，集中在它对 <code>fetch</code> 事件的拦截上。页面发出的每一个网络请求——加载脚本、拉取 API、请求图片——都会先经过 Service Worker 的手。在这一刻，它要做一个决定：这个请求是去网络拿、去缓存拿、还是两者结合？这个决定就是缓存策略。选对了，应用在地铁里断网也能秒开；选错了，用户要么看到三天前的陈旧数据，要么在弱网下苦等转圈。缓存策略不是技术细节，而是直接决定产品体验的设计选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>所有缓存策略都建立在 Cache Storage API 与 <code>fetch</code> 事件之上。Cache Storage 是一个专为 Service Worker 设计的、以 <code>Request</code> 为键、<code>Response</code> 为值的持久化存储。<code>fetch</code> 事件让 Service Worker 拦截请求，并用 <code>event.respondWith()</code> 决定如何应答。基本骨架是这样的：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;fetch&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  event.respondWith(handleRequest(event.request));&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">self.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fetch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">respondWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.request));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>handleRequest</code> 内部如何在缓存与网络之间取舍，就划分出五种经典策略。下图按「先看缓存还是先看网络」把它们排成一谱：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[fetch 请求到达] --&gt; Q{缓存策略}&#10;  Q --&gt;|Cache First| C1[查缓存&lt;br/&gt;命中即返回&lt;br/&gt;未命中再走网络]&#10;  Q --&gt;|Network First| N1[走网络&lt;br/&gt;成功即返回&lt;br/&gt;失败回退缓存]&#10;  Q --&gt;|Stale While Revalidate| S1[立即返回缓存&lt;br/&gt;同时后台更新缓存]&#10;  Q --&gt;|Cache Only| C2[只读缓存&lt;br/&gt;不碰网络]&#10;  Q --&gt;|Network Only| N2[只走网络&lt;br/&gt;不碰缓存]\">flowchart TD\n  R[fetch 请求到达] --&gt; Q{缓存策略}\n  Q --&gt;|Cache First| C1[查缓存&lt;br/&gt;命中即返回&lt;br/&gt;未命中再走网络]\n  Q --&gt;|Network First| N1[走网络&lt;br/&gt;成功即返回&lt;br/&gt;失败回退缓存]\n  Q --&gt;|Stale While Revalidate| S1[立即返回缓存&lt;br/&gt;同时后台更新缓存]\n  Q --&gt;|Cache Only| C2[只读缓存&lt;br/&gt;不碰网络]\n  Q --&gt;|Network Only| N2[只走网络&lt;br/&gt;不碰缓存]</pre><h2 id=\"五种基本策略与适用场景\">五种基本策略与适用场景</h2><p>每种策略都有它最擅长的资源类型，错配是大多数缓存问题的根源。</p>\n<p><strong>Cache First（缓存优先）</strong> 先查缓存，命中直接返回，未命中才走网络并顺手缓存。它把延迟降到最低，适合「一旦发布就不会变」的资源——带哈希指纹的 JS/CSS 包、字体、长期图片。代价是：如果缓存了一个会变的资源，用户会一直看到旧的。</p>\n<p><strong>Network First（网络优先）</strong> 先走网络，成功返回并更新缓存，失败才回退到缓存。它保证内容尽量新鲜，适合时效性强、但断网时旧数据聊胜于无的场景——用户的动态时间线、账户余额。代价是：网络慢时每次都要等超时才回退，体验受网络拖累。</p>\n<p><strong>Stale While Revalidate（陈旧但重新验证）</strong> 立刻返回缓存（即使是旧的），同时在后台静默请求网络更新缓存，供下次使用。它在「快」和「新」之间取了巧妙的平衡，适合「稍微旧一点也无妨」的资源——头像、不太敏感的列表数据。代价是用户这一次看到的可能是上一次的版本。</p>\n<p><strong>Cache Only</strong> 与 <strong>Network Only</strong> 是两个极端，前者完全离线（适合预缓存且永不变的外壳），后者完全绕过缓存（适合绝不能用旧数据的请求，如支付提交）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// Stale While Revalidate 的手写实现&#10;async function staleWhileRevalidate(request) {&#10;  const cache = await caches.open(&#39;runtime-v1&#39;);&#10;  const cached = await cache.match(request);&#10;  const network = fetch(request).then((res) =&gt; {&#10;    cache.put(request, res.clone()); // 后台静默更新&#10;    return res;&#10;  });&#10;  return cached || network; // 有缓存先返回缓存，否则等网络&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Stale While Revalidate 的手写实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> staleWhileRevalidate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cache</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> caches.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'runtime-v1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cached</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> network</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cache.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request, res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clone</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 后台静默更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cached </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> network; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 有缓存先返回缓存，否则等网络</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>新鲜度</th>\n<th>离线可用</th>\n<th>典型资源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cache First</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>最差</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>带指纹的静态资源、字体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network First</td>\n<td>受网络影响</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>降级可用</td>\n<td>时效性 API、动态内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stale While Revalidate</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中（延迟一拍）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>头像、非关键列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache Only</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>取决于预缓存</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>应用外壳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network Only</td>\n<td>受网络影响</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>支付、登录等关键写操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"按请求类型路由\">按请求类型路由</h2><p>真实应用从不只用一种策略，而是按请求类型分发：HTML 文档走 Network First（保证导航拿到最新版），静态资源走 Cache First，API 走 Stale While Revalidate 或 Network First。这种「按 URL 模式匹配不同策略」的模式叫路由（routing），手写起来就是在 <code>fetch</code> 处理器里一连串 <code>if</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;fetch&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const url = new URL(event.request.url);&#10;  if (event.request.mode === &#39;navigate&#39;) {&#10;    event.respondWith(networkFirst(event.request)); // 页面导航&#10;  } else if (url.pathname.startsWith(&#39;/api/&#39;)) {&#10;    event.respondWith(staleWhileRevalidate(event.request)); // 接口&#10;  } else if (/\\.(js|css|woff2)$/.test(url.pathname)) {&#10;    event.respondWith(cacheFirst(event.request)); // 静态资源&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">self.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fetch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.request.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event.request.mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'navigate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">respondWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">networkFirst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.request)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 页面导航</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (url.pathname.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">respondWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">staleWhileRevalidate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.request)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(js</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">css</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">woff2)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url.pathname)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">respondWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cacheFirst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.request)); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 静态资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>路由逻辑一旦复杂，手写就容易出错。这正是 Workbox 解决的问题——它把策略和路由都封装成声明式 API。</p>\n<h2 id=\"workbox-策略的工业化封装\">Workbox：策略的工业化封装</h2><p>Workbox 是 Google 维护的 Service Worker 工具库，把上面所有策略和路由模式收敛成稳定、可组合的高阶 API。截至 2026 年，Workbox 已能原生集成进 Vite、webpack、Next.js 等主流构建链。用它改写上面的路由：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { registerRoute } from &#39;workbox-routing&#39;;&#10;import { CacheFirst, NetworkFirst, StaleWhileRevalidate } from &#39;workbox-strategies&#39;;&#10;import { ExpirationPlugin } from &#39;workbox-expiration&#39;;&#10;&#10;registerRoute(({ request }) =&gt; request.mode === &#39;navigate&#39;, new NetworkFirst());&#10;&#10;registerRoute(({ url }) =&gt; url.pathname.startsWith(&#39;/api/&#39;), new StaleWhileRevalidate({ cacheName: &#39;api&#39; }));&#10;&#10;registerRoute(&#10;  ({ request }) =&gt; [&#39;style&#39;, &#39;script&#39;, &#39;font&#39;].includes(request.destination),&#10;  new CacheFirst({&#10;    cacheName: &#39;assets&#39;,&#10;    plugins: [new ExpirationPlugin({ maxEntries: 60, maxAgeSeconds: 30 * 24 * 3600 })],&#10;  }),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { registerRoute } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'workbox-routing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { CacheFirst, NetworkFirst, StaleWhileRevalidate } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'workbox-strategies'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ExpirationPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'workbox-expiration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'navigate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NetworkFirst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url.pathname.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StaleWhileRevalidate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ cacheName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">registerRoute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'style'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'script'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'font'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request.destination),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CacheFirst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cacheName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assets'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExpirationPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ maxEntries: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maxAgeSeconds: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 24</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Workbox 的真正价值不止于少写代码，更在于它的插件生态：<code>ExpirationPlugin</code> 自动按数量或时效淘汰缓存，避免缓存无限膨胀撑爆存储配额；其他插件还能处理缓存失败回退、广播缓存更新等。Workbox 的预缓存清单生成、与 <a href=\"../engineering/update-strategies\">更新策略与版本</a> 的版本管理、以及 <a href=\"offline-first\">离线优先架构</a> 的整合，都建立在这套策略基础之上。值得一提的是，Workbox 的后台同步能力（<code>workbox-background-sync</code>）则衔接到 <a href=\"../capabilities/background-sync\">后台同步</a> 一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>缓存策略的本质是 Service Worker 拦截 <code>fetch</code> 后，在缓存与网络之间做的取舍，直接决定速度、新鲜度与离线能力。</li>\n<li>五种基本策略各有所长：Cache First 求快、Network First 求新、Stale While Revalidate 折中、Cache/Network Only 走极端。</li>\n<li>错配策略是缓存问题的主因——给会变的资源用 Cache First 会让用户卡在旧版，给关键写操作用缓存则可能出严重错误。</li>\n<li>真实应用按请求类型路由：导航走 Network First、静态资源走 Cache First、API 走 SWR 或 Network First。</li>\n<li>Workbox 把策略与路由工业化封装，配合 ExpirationPlugin 等插件管理缓存生命周期，是生产 PWA 的事实标准工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存策略","id":"缓存策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"五种基本策略与适用场景","id":"五种基本策略与适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"按请求类型路由","id":"按请求类型路由"},{"level":2,"text":"Workbox：策略的工业化封装","id":"workbox-策略的工业化封装"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Service Worker 生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-production-engineering/service-worker/sw-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"离线优先架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-production-engineering/service-worker/offline-first"}}